# Line endings that the *payload* depends on.
#
# The NAS packages (飞牛 fnOS .fpk, Unraid, Docker) are assembled straight from
# the working tree, and fnOS runs `cmd/*` through /bin/bash while parsing
# `manifest`, `config/*` and `app/ui/config` as plain text. A Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise ship CRLF: the shebang turns into
# `#!/bin/bash\r`, INI values keep a trailing `\r` (so `appname` no longer
# matches) and the install/start scripts fail on the device.
*.sh         text eol=lf
gradlew      text eol=lf
Dockerfile   text eol=lf
*.yml        text eol=lf
*.yaml       text eol=lf
packaging/** text eol=lf

# Images must never be normalised — keep them byte-exact.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.fpk binary
*.so  binary
*.dll binary
